        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Smith Auctioneers are delighted to bring to the market this 4 bedroom bungalow located in a much sought after residential area within walking distance of Boyle Town and all its local amenities such as schools, churches, shops, medical centres, railway station. Only a short drive to well renowned Lough Key Forest & Activity Park and all its facilities.\r\n\r\nThis house is in turn-key condition throughout and would make an ideal family home or investment property.\r\n\r\nViewing is highly recommended and by appointment only.\r\n\r\nAccommodation\r\nLiving Room \r\nWith Wooden Floor and Fireplace\r\n\r\nKitchen/Dining Area\r\nWith fully fitted kitchen and tiled Flooring\r\n\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 \r\nWith Wooden Floor and En Suite\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 \r\nWith Carpeted Floor and Built in Wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 3 \r\nWith Carpeted Floor and Built in Wardrobe\r\n\r\nBedroom 4\r\nWith wooden floor and Built in Wardrobe\r\n\r\nBathroom (2.16m x 1.63m)\r\nWith Bath & Electric Shower\r\n\r\nWC (1.70m x 1.14m)\r\nWith wc & whb\r\n\r\nHeating:\r\nOil Fired Central Heating \r\nSolar Panels\r\n\r\n\r\nExternal:\r\nMature Garden to Front\r\nGarage\r\nOff Street Parking at Front\r\n\r\nAll Mains Services"
      },
